    <div class="sf_colsOut&#32;sf_2cols_2_50">
        <div id="ContentPlaceholder_T3A13E1F0004_Col01" class="sf_colsIn&#32;sf_2cols_2in_50"><div class='sfContentBlock'><h2>Before You Begin&hellip;</h2>
<p>If you or your organization has never registered in the Grants Management System, you should review the&nbsp;<a href="https://legis.delaware.gov/docs/default-source/gia/MyDelawareandGrantsManagementSystemRegistrationGuide8a22e7feaf2a6dfeae60ff0000a39f38.pdf" title="Click to Review the Grants Management System At-A-Glance" target="_blank">My Delaware and Grants Management System Registration Guide</a>&nbsp;to prepare for the initial registration process.</p>

</div><div class='sfContentBlock'><h2><strong><br />
What&rsquo;s New</strong></h2>
<p><strong>Upcoming Changes to Grant-in-Aid Eligibility and Requirements. </strong><a href="https://legis.delaware.gov/BillDetail?LegislationId=142311">House Bill 190, from the 153rd General Assembly</a>, as amended, establishes new statutory requirements governing eligibility for Delaware Grant-in-Aid funding, application documentation, allowable uses of funding, and financial accountability. <strong>These requirements will take effect July 1, 2028, beginning with the Fiscal Year 2029 Grant-in-Aid application cycle.</strong></p>
<p>Organizations that currently receive Grant-in-Aid funding, as well as organizations that may apply in the future, are encouraged to familiarize themselves with these requirements and begin preparing for compliance in advance of the effective date.</p>
<p> To review an overview of the major changes introduced by this legislation, please review the <a href="https://legis.delaware.gov/Offices/ControllerGeneral/GrantinAid/HB190">Grant-in-Aid - HB190 site</a>&nbsp;or <a href="https://legis.delaware.gov/docs/default-source/gia/UpcomingChangestoGrant-in-AidEligibilityandRequirements.pdf">download a summary</a>.</p>

</div><div class='sfContentBlock'><br />
<h2>Important Information</h2>
<ul>
    <li><a href="https://legis.delaware.gov/docs/default-source/gia/GIAFrequentlyAskedQuestionsa622e7feaf2a6dfeae60ff0000a39f38.pdf" title="Frequently Asked Questions" target="_blank">Frequently Asked Questions</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://legis.delaware.gov/docs/default-source/gia/giafrequentlyaskedquestions.pdf?sfvrsn=997f8d38_17" title="Frequently Asked Questions" target="_blank"></a><a href="https://legis.delaware.gov/GrantInAid/Information" title="GIA Qualifications and Analyst Assignments" target="_blank">GIA Qualifications and Analyst Assignments</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://legis.delaware.gov/docs/default-source/gia/UpcomingChangestoGrant-in-AidEligibilityandRequirements.pdf">Summary of Upcoming Changes to Grant-in-Aid Eligibility and Requirements from House Bill 190</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://legis.delaware.gov/GrantInAid/Information" title="GIA Qualifications and Analyst Assignments" target="_blank"></a><a href="https://legis.delaware.gov/Committee/JointFinance" title="Joint Finance Committee Public Hearing Page" target="_blank">Joint Finance Committee Public Hearing Page</a></li>
</ul>

</div><div class='sfContentBlock'><br />
<h2><strong>Additional System User Aids &amp; Guides</strong></h2>
<ul>
    <li><a id="ctl00_ContentPlaceholder_ctl06_ctl00_ctl00_dynamicContentListView_ctrl0_TheLink" href="https://legis.delaware.gov/docs/default-source/gia/GrantsManagementSystemHomeScreenOverviewAt-A-Glance.pdf" title="Grants Management System Home Screen Overview At-A-Glance" target="_blank">Grants Management System Home Screen Overview At-A-Glance</a>
    </li>
    <li><a id="ctl00_ContentPlaceholder_ctl06_ctl00_ctl00_dynamicContentListView_ctrl1_TheLink" href="https://legis.delaware.gov/docs/default-source/gia/GuidetoAddandInviteNewContactstoRegistertoanOrganizationd222e7feaf2a6dfeae60ff0000a39f38.pdf" title="Guide to Add and Invite New Contacts to Register to an Organization" target="_blank">Guide to Add and Invite New Contacts to Register to an Organization</a></li>
    <li><a id="ctl00_ContentPlaceholder_ctl06_ctl00_ctl00_dynamicContentListView_ctrl2_TheLink" href="https://legis.delaware.gov/docs/default-source/gia/guidetoCompleteInvitedNewContactRegistrationtoanOrganizatione222e7feaf2a6dfeae60ff0000a39f38.pdf" title="Guide to Complete Invited New Contact Registration to an Organization" target="_blank">Guide to Complete Invited New Contact Registration to an Organization</a><a id="ctl00_ContentPlaceholder_ctl06_ctl00_ctl00_dynamicContentListView_ctrl3_TheLink">
    </a></li>
    <li><a id="ctl00_ContentPlaceholder_ctl06_ctl00_ctl00_dynamicContentListView_ctrl3_TheLink" href="https://legis.delaware.gov/docs/default-source/gia/GuideforAddinganApplicationCollaboratorab22e7feaf2a6dfeae60ff0000a39f38.pdf" title="Guide for Adding an Application Collaborator" target="_blank">Guide for Adding an Application Collaborator</a></li>
    <li><a id="ctl00_ContentPlaceholder_ctl06_ctl00_ctl00_dynamicContentListView_ctrl4_TheLink" href="https://legis.delaware.gov/docs/default-source/gia/GuidetoViewSaveorPrintaPDFcopyofyourGrantApplicationdd22e7feaf2a6dfeae60ff0000a39f38.pdf" title="Guide to View, Save, or Print a PDF copy of your Grant Application" target="_blank">Guide to View, Save, or Print a PDF copy of your Grant Application</a></li>
    <li><a id="ctl00_ContentPlaceholder_ctl06_ctl00_ctl00_dynamicContentListView_ctrl5_TheLink" href="https://legis.delaware.gov/docs/default-source/gia/GuideforRepresentingMultipleOrganizationsac22e7feaf2a6dfeae60ff0000a39f38.pdf" title="Guide for Representing Multiple Organizations" target="_blank">Guide for Representing Multiple Organizations</a></li>
</ul>

</div><div class='sfContentBlock'><h2><strong><br />
Current &amp; Prior Year Grants-In-Aid Acts</strong></h2>
<ul>
    <li><a href="https://legis.delaware.gov/BillDetail?LegislationId=143661" title="SB 337 – Fiscal Year 2027 Grants-In-Aid Act" target="_blank">SB 337&nbsp;&ndash;&nbsp;Fiscal Year 2027 Grants-In-Aid Act</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://legis.delaware.gov/BillDetail?LegislationId=142646" title="HB 230 – Fiscal Year 2026 Grants-In-Aid Act" target="_blank">HB 230 &ndash; Fiscal Year 2026 Grants-In-Aid Act</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://legis.delaware.gov/BillDetail/141695" title="SB 327 – Fiscal Year 2025 Grants-In-Aid Act" target="_blank">SB 327 &ndash; Fiscal Year 2025 Grants-In-Aid Act</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://legis.delaware.gov/BillDetail?LegislationId=140762" title="HB 197 – Fiscal Year 2024 Grants-In-Aid Act" target="_blank">HB 197 &ndash; Fiscal Year 2024 Grants-In-Aid Act</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://legis.delaware.gov/BillDetail?LegislationId=129856" title="SB 252 – Fiscal Year 2023 Grants-In-Aid Act" target="_blank">SB 252 &ndash; Fiscal Year 2023 Grants-In-Aid Act</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://legis.delaware.gov/Offices/ControllerGeneral/AppropriationBills" title="All Other Appropriations Bills" target="_blank">All Other Appropriations Bills</a></li>
</ul>

