</div><div class='sfContentBlock'><p>&nbsp;</p>
<h2>Availability to the Public of Submitted Information </h2>
<p>All materials submitted during the grant application process are subject to public inspection upon request by the Freedom of Information Act (FOIA). Please provide a separate document listing any information in the application or financial documents and audits that you believe to be a trade secret or commercial or financial information that is privileged or confidential under FOIA, specifically&nbsp;<a href="https://delcode.delaware.gov/title29/c100/index.shtml#10002">&sect; 10002(o)(2) of Title 29</a> of the Delaware Code.</p>

</div><div class="sf_cols">
    <div class="sf_colsOut&#32;sf_1col_1_100">
        <div id="ContentPlaceholder_T3A13E1F0005_Col00" class="sf_colsIn&#32;sf_1col_1in_100">
            
